  "slug": "2026-taiwan-creative-expo",
  "name": "2026 臺灣文博會 品牌商展",
  "nameEn": "Creative Expo Taiwan 2026 — Creative Brands",
  "summary": "臺灣最大的文化品牌年度展會，8 月 6 至 12 日在南港展覽館一館登場，逾 870 個品牌參展。免費入場，可線上預約或現場排隊。以下是本站收錄品牌中，確認參展的 38 個攤位。",
  "summaryEn": "Taiwan's largest annual cultural-brand showcase, 6–12 August at Taipei Nangang Exhibition Center, Hall 1. Free entry by online reservation or walk-in queue. Below are the 38 exhibiting booths held by brands already in our directory.",
  "description": "臺灣文博會是臺灣規模最大的文化品牌年度展會，2026 年的品牌商展於 8 月 6 日至 12 日在臺北南港展覽館一館一樓舉行，逾 870 個品牌、1,200 個攤位參展。\n\n展場分為三個展區：IP 授權展區、文創品牌展區、新銳品牌展區。本頁只收錄後兩者：本站收錄的是實體商品品牌，而 IP 授權展區以角色授權、圖像應用與國際代理為主，性質不同。\n\n8 月 6 日至 7 日為專業買家日（10:00–18:00），一般民眾可於 8 月 8 日至 9 日（10:00–20:00）及 8 月 10 日至 12 日（10:00–18:00）入場。免費參觀，今年首度採線上預約與現場排隊雙軌制，未預約者仍可現場排隊入場。\n\n關於下列名單：參展攤位為付費租用，主辦單位僅做資格審查，因此「有參展」不等於本站的推薦或背書。唯一的例外是新銳品牌展區，該區 100 個攤位由評審依市場力、創新力與設計力評選產生，是實質的篩選結果。",
  "descriptionEn": "Creative Expo Taiwan is the country's largest annual showcase for cultural and creative brands. Its 2026 brand trade show runs 6–12 August at Taipei Nangang Exhibition Center, Hall 1, with over 870 brands across more than 1,200 booths.\n\nThe floor is split into three zones: IP Licensing, Cultural & Creative Brands, and Start-ups. This page covers only the latter two. Formoria lists physical product brands, while the IP Licensing zone deals in character licensing, illustration rights, and international agency work — a different business.\n\n6–7 August are trade-buyer days (10:00–18:00). General admission runs 8–9 August (10:00–20:00) and 10–12 August (10:00–18:00). Entry is free, and for the first time there are two ways in: reserve a time slot online, or queue on the day.\n\nA note on the list below: booths are paid, and the organizer screens for eligibility rather than curating. Exhibiting is therefore not an endorsement from us. The one exception is the Start-ups zone, where all 100 booths are awarded by a jury scoring market strength, innovation, and design.",
